(6449914, 957622, 110403, '<td valign="top">I think you misunderstood the topic of the challenge. it''s an advertisement for the alcohol ABSOLUT, not just any advertisement. Having said that, putting that DNMC aside, this pic has it''s own problem too, the gun doesn''t look new to me, can''t really be in an advertisement. Afterall, not a bad picture indeed.</td>', 'I think you misunderstood the topic of the challenge. it''s an advertisement for the alcohol ABSOLUT, not just any advertisement. Having said that, putting that DNMC aside, this pic has it''s own problem too, the gun doesn''t look new to me, can''t really be in an advertisement. Afterall, not a bad picture indeed.', '2011-06-22 02:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449916, 957948, 28742, '<td valign="top">Very clever, good setup. Technicals (lighting, focus) are not perfect, but ok. Crop/comp is what bothers me the most. You probably didn''t need to include the entire pan, and then some. tighter on the "bottle" would have helped. Best of luck!</td>', 'Very clever, good setup. Technicals (lighting, focus) are not perfect, but ok. Crop/comp is what bothers me the most. You probably didn''t need to include the entire pan, and then some. tighter on the "bottle" would have helped. Best of luck!', '2011-06-22 02:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
