(6450701, 957727, 18778, '<td valign="top">Took me a moment to notice the coke logo on the glass.  Overall- this is a beautiful effect.  I like the way you utilized the entire frame and I find the color choice of red, white &amp; blue to be classic &amp; appealing.  Interesting decision for the condensation to be in focus and to blur the absolut logo.  I also like the way the liquid level serves as a subtle ''underline''. I like it.  Unexpected, simple and cool.</td>', 'Took me a moment to notice the coke logo on the glass.  Overall- this is a beautiful effect.  I like the way you utilized the entire frame and I find the color choice of red, white & blue to be classic & appealing.  Interesting decision for the condensation to be in focus and to blur the absolut logo.  I also like the way the liquid level serves as a subtle ''underline''. I like it.  Unexpected, simple and cool.', '2011-06-23 01:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
