(6450728, 957950, 18778, '<td valign="top">Love the title.  Howeves, how would I know this had anything to do with Absolut?  The label is completely illegible.  &amp; this is my personal feeling, but I would have taken the safety wrapper off the top.  Also, the crop you chose cuts off the bottom of the bottle.  Cool idea... the execution?  With ice as your primary subject, I would imagine some really good lighting possiblities</td>', 'Love the title.  Howeves, how would I know this had anything to do with Absolut?  The label is completely illegible.  & this is my personal feeling, but I would have taken the safety wrapper off the top.  Also, the crop you chose cuts off the bottom of the bottle.  Cool idea... the execution?  With ice as your primary subject, I would imagine some really good lighting possiblities', '2011-06-23 02:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
