(6450867, 957981, 18778, '<td valign="top">This image feels off for me.  The word ''imported'' is not only the most legible word on the screen, but it''s also the center of your piece.  The lighting seems to only capture 2/3 of the rose- almost giving the appearance of a vignette that exists only on the right side of the image balanced by what looks like a hand? on the upper left. All of that to say, I would recommend a cleaner image in hopes of a clear concept to be given to the audience.</td>', 'This image feels off for me.  The word ''imported'' is not only the most legible word on the screen, but it''s also the center of your piece.  The lighting seems to only capture 2/3 of the rose- almost giving the appearance of a vignette that exists only on the right side of the image balanced by what looks like a hand? on the upper left. All of that to say, I would recommend a cleaner image in hopes of a clear concept to be given to the audience.', '2011-06-23 09:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450872, 957638, 18778, '<td valign="top">I love the colors depicted here- especially the sharpness/texture given to the rock.  The concept is a little loose here.  How does the sail boat tie in?  By choosing to keep your subject on the lower half of your image- the viewer gets a lot of empty space up top and then a boat is as dominate as your primary subject.  Feels like it''s competing for attention as opposed to supporting the Absolut image.  The bottle just seems to be there. Also, &amp; this is merely a pp of this challenge for me- but I would have taken the safety wrapper off!</td>', 'I love the colors depicted here- especially the sharpness/texture given to the rock.  The concept is a little loose here.  How does the sail boat tie in?  By choosing to keep your subject on the lower half of your image- the viewer gets a lot of empty space up top and then a boat is as dominate as your primary subject.  Feels like it''s competing for attention as opposed to supporting the Absolut image.  The bottle just seems to be there. Also, & this is merely a pp of this challenge for me- but I would have taken the safety wrapper off!', '2011-06-23 10:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450879, 957948, 18778, '<td valign="top">I dig it!  It''s basic &amp; I have no idea how it relates to vodka- but I appreciate the creativity!  I also like the very basic color scheme keeping the image/idea tight.</td>', 'I dig it!  It''s basic & I have no idea how it relates to vodka- but I appreciate the creativity!  I also like the very basic color scheme keeping the image/idea tight.', '2011-06-23 10:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450885, 957956, 18778, '<td valign="top">I beautiful capture, but I want more from it.  From an editing standpoint, I would have considered making some of the black script text a little more bold as to not be lost in the background.  The choice of bottle positioning here is...?  From the viewers standpoint, the word ''Absolut'' is not as legible as the word ''Vodka''</td>', 'I beautiful capture, but I want more from it.  From an editing standpoint, I would have considered making some of the black script text a little more bold as to not be lost in the background.  The choice of bottle positioning here is...?  From the viewers standpoint, the word ''Absolut'' is not as legible as the word ''Vodka''', '2011-06-23 10:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450890, 957514, 18778, '<td valign="top">Where to begin...<br/>What does this have to do with Absolut?  The model looks incredible awkward holding the bottle in that position. The combination of lighting and this crop, she also comes across headless (sans the random arm fragment) as well as having ''amputated'' feet. And as far as the title- I''m not feeling pleasure with this image.  I''m feeling like this is a rejected CPS advertisement. *cringes*</td>', 'Where to begin...What does this have to do with Absolut?  The model looks incredible awkward holding the bottle in that position. The combination of lighting and this crop, she also comes across headless (sans the random arm fragment) as well as having ''amputated'' feet. And as far as the title- I''m not feeling pleasure with this image.  I''m feeling like this is a rejected CPS advertisement. *cringes*', '2011-06-23 10:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450897, 957967, 5885, '<td valign="top">Interesting, although Absolut is not a potato-based vodka.</td>', 'Interesting, although Absolut is not a potato-based vodka.', '2011-06-23 10:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450911, 957582, 43774, '<td valign="top">Neat setup and good lighting.</td>', 'Neat setup and good lighting.', '2011-06-23 11:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450913, 957785, 124346, '<td valign="top">Beautiful set up.  The mirror look so clean and sharp, and the background so nice.  I''d love to imitate that in a picture of my own.</td>', 'Beautiful set up.  The mirror look so clean and sharp, and the background so nice.  I''d love to imitate that in a picture of my own.', '2011-06-23 12:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450914, 957982, 16241, '<td valign="top">this is could be an add, i''d get hold of them if i were you.  blue ribbon</td>', 'this is could be an add, i''d get hold of them if i were you.  blue ribbon', '2011-06-23 12:07:14.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6450933, 957317, 100831, '<td valign="top">now that''s a lot of push pins!!! Great idea!!! And it works. 8</td>', 'now that''s a lot of push pins!!! Great idea!!! And it works. 8', '2011-06-23 13:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450936, 957972, 100831, '<td valign="top">ha ha ha... ( and it''s about how I feel after looking through all the pictures in this challenge - oops I didn''t really say that out loud, did I?). I like this. 8</td>', 'ha ha ha... ( and it''s about how I feel after looking through all the pictures in this challenge - oops I didn''t really say that out loud, did I?). I like this. 8', '2011-06-23 13:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450937, 957306, 100831, '<td valign="top">terrific - works really well!!</td>', 'terrific - works really well!!', '2011-06-23 13:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450941, 957466, 86218, '<td valign="top">:) Great idea and creative 8</td>', ':) Great idea and creative 8', '2011-06-23 14:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450943, 957785, 86218, '<td valign="top">I truly dont get this shot but as a photo 7... Maybe I would have rated it better if I understood the message and saw the relevance of the grossness of the scene with the drink that as far as I know should be a stately one..</td>', 'I truly dont get this shot but as a photo 7... Maybe I would have rated it better if I understood the message and saw the relevance of the grossness of the scene with the drink that as far as I know should be a stately one..', '2011-06-23 14:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450946, 957892, 86218, '<td valign="top">This wont do well. But you have my vote of one of my favourites</td>', 'This wont do well. But you have my vote of one of my favourites', '2011-06-23 14:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450949, 957948, 86218, '<td valign="top">LOL.... Love your humour and creativity here</td>', 'LOL.... Love your humour and creativity here', '2011-06-23 14:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450960, 957982, 86218, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Just curious as to how you did this... lol. i dont like to think this much when I relax to vote on images 9</td>', 'Great shot. Just curious as to how you did this... lol. i dont like to think this much when I relax to vote on images 9', '2011-06-23 14:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451002, 957622, 125275, '<td valign="top">I like the filter/effect on this. The silvery/HDRish tones are awesome. Obviously DNMC and will probably brown. I assume that''s what you wanted?</td>', 'I like the filter/effect on this. The silvery/HDRish tones are awesome. Obviously DNMC and will probably brown. I assume that''s what you wanted?', '2011-06-23 16:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451006, 957780, 125275, '<td valign="top">I''m too literal. I think "how did they fill up that glass and there is still a full bottle?" I''m not docking points for that of course, it''s just where my brain goes. Besides, that''s probably how it''d be in an actual advertisement, which is what this looks like. Love the lighthing and reflections. Nice cool color temperature too. Bonus point for not leaving the plastic seal on! :-P</td>', 'I''m too literal. I think "how did they fill up that glass and there is still a full bottle?" I''m not docking points for that of course, it''s just where my brain goes. Besides, that''s probably how it''d be in an actual advertisement, which is what this looks like. Love the lighthing and reflections. Nice cool color temperature too. Bonus point for not leaving the plastic seal on! :-P', '2011-06-23 16:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451031, 957683, 125275, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting on this.</td>', 'Interesting lighting on this.', '2011-06-23 16:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451033, 957950, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome idea (meaning, I had a similar one). I think this image could be improved by showing the whole bottle and taking the plastic off the lid. Otherwise, I like everything else about it.</td>', 'This is an awesome idea (meaning, I had a similar one). I think this image could be improved by showing the whole bottle and taking the plastic off the lid. Otherwise, I like everything else about it.', '2011-06-23 16:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451034, 957982, 125275, '<td valign="top">I am definitely interested in learning how this was done! Nice, clear capture as well.</td>', 'I am definitely interested in learning how this was done! Nice, clear capture as well.', '2011-06-23 16:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451036, 957985, 125275, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the liquid is lit well enough to provide an explanation. On second thought, I''m not sure if it was well lit enough it would make sense. I like the image as long as I do not try to figure out what it "means."</td>', 'I''m not sure the liquid is lit well enough to provide an explanation. On second thought, I''m not sure if it was well lit enough it would make sense. I like the image as long as I do not try to figure out what it "means."', '2011-06-23 16:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451037, 957915, 125275, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle and lighting here.</td>', 'Interesting angle and lighting here.', '2011-06-23 16:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451038, 957961, 125275, '<td valign="top">I like how the smoke is grainy but the bottle is clear. Nice.</td>', 'I like how the smoke is grainy but the bottle is clear. Nice.', '2011-06-23 16:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451040, 957086, 125275, '<td valign="top">Any title would have been better than "untitled," especially in this challenge. I suggest "Abstract-olut."</td>', 'Any title would have been better than "untitled," especially in this challenge. I suggest "Abstract-olut."', '2011-06-23 16:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451041, 957317, 125275, '<td valign="top">I like this. I also submitted a "bottle-less" picture. What helped me form the shape was printing out a full sized outline. You might have done that, then put the pins on the border and build out from there. Still, this is incredible and looks amazingly organized!</td>', 'I like this. I also submitted a "bottle-less" picture. What helped me form the shape was printing out a full sized outline. You might have done that, then put the pins on the border and build out from there. Still, this is incredible and looks amazingly organized!', '2011-06-23 16:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451082, 957961, 43774, '<td valign="top">From the thumbnail I thought the yellow was feathers.  I''m not sure how you made the smoke yellow. It''s a bit grainy which isn''t too bad. The overall photo is a bit dark and contrasty. It''s not bad but not wow either.</td>', 'From the thumbnail I thought the yellow was feathers.  I''m not sure how you made the smoke yellow. It''s a bit grainy which isn''t too bad. The overall photo is a bit dark and contrasty. It''s not bad but not wow either.', '2011-06-23 17:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451119, 957468, 132996, '<td valign="top">This is excellent. The soft curves of the bottle complement the calmness that the water adds. The addition of the rocks really keeps the viewer inside the photo and not floating away so to speak (though I think the bottom rock might restrict the viewer just a bit).</td>', 'This is excellent. The soft curves of the bottle complement the calmness that the water adds. The addition of the rocks really keeps the viewer inside the photo and not floating away so to speak (though I think the bottom rock might restrict the viewer just a bit).', '2011-06-23 19:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451121, 957987, 59796, '<td valign="top">I hope this ribbons..<br/>I love the minimalistic feel and the fabulous lighting.</td>', 'I hope this ribbons..I love the minimalistic feel and the fabulous lighting.', '2011-06-23 19:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451122, 957982, 132996, '<td valign="top">Absolutely clever image. My eye starts at the bottle and travels with the stream to the glass. I think the image could do without the second bottom glass, but it appears it might have been necessary to make the image. The image of the bottle is almost flawless (with the exception of some fogginess and a bit of yellow at the bottle''s opening) and I love the droplets everywhere. Great job! I''m still a bit perplexed at how you did it.</td>', 'Absolutely clever image. My eye starts at the bottle and travels with the stream to the glass. I think the image could do without the second bottom glass, but it appears it might have been necessary to make the image. The image of the bottle is almost flawless (with the exception of some fogginess and a bit of yellow at the bottle''s opening) and I love the droplets everywhere. Great job! I''m still a bit perplexed at how you did it.', '2011-06-23 19:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451124, 957753, 59796, '<td valign="top">My pick for blue.<br/>The mood, the lighting, the concept - they all work wonderfully well together. Excellent!</td>', 'My pick for blue.The mood, the lighting, the concept - they all work wonderfully well together. Excellent!', '2011-06-23 19:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451126, 957982, 59796, '<td valign="top">I hope this ribbons.<br/>Must''ve needed some awesome co-ordination to pull this off! I''d love to see your setup for this.</td>', 'I hope this ribbons.Must''ve needed some awesome co-ordination to pull this off! I''d love to see your setup for this.', '2011-06-23 19:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451129, 957920, 132996, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent image. The olives really lead the viewer to the centerpiece: the glass. I wish there was a bit more negative space on the left of the image...the olives are so close to the image''s edge that I feel a bit of tension. I think it would also be cool to have the vodka also midair, pouring vodka in the glass...probably difficult to accomplish though...and possibly it would only add some more wow factor. Compositionally, the two glasses balance the action on both sides, though. The colors are phenomenal here: the yellows and reds balance the deep blues beautifully.</td>', 'This is an excellent image. The olives really lead the viewer to the centerpiece: the glass. I wish there was a bit more negative space on the left of the image...the olives are so close to the image''s edge that I feel a bit of tension. I think it would also be cool to have the vodka also midair, pouring vodka in the glass...probably difficult to accomplish though...and possibly it would only add some more wow factor. Compositionally, the two glasses balance the action on both sides, though. The colors are phenomenal here: the yellows and reds balance the deep blues beautifully.', '2011-06-23 19:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451133, 957190, 132996, '<td valign="top">Very interesting take on the concept and use of contrast. The vignette is good for this center composition...it''s keeping the viewers inside. The jagged shapes add to your hardcore theme.</td>', 'Very interesting take on the concept and use of contrast. The vignette is good for this center composition...it''s keeping the viewers inside. The jagged shapes add to your hardcore theme.', '2011-06-23 19:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451136, 957433, 59796, '<td valign="top">My top 5. <br/>Very simple concept nicely executed with good back lighting. <br/>The reflection is a bit blurry (probably a mirror and not plastic?) but that''s about the only nit I can pick after staring at it for a while. Neat!</td>', 'My top 5. Very simple concept nicely executed with good back lighting. The reflection is a bit blurry (probably a mirror and not plastic?) but that''s about the only nit I can pick after staring at it for a while. Neat!', '2011-06-23 19:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451137, 957956, 132996, '<td valign="top">I really like this photograph. It''s very peaceful...the way the horizon flows and suddenly becomes clear in the reflection in the glass (yet it still undulates like a wave in the reflection). I''m glad you used a border...I''m not being thrown out of the image in any way despite the fact that your subject is partially out of the frame.</td>', 'I really like this photograph. It''s very peaceful...the way the horizon flows and suddenly becomes clear in the reflection in the glass (yet it still undulates like a wave in the reflection). I''m glad you used a border...I''m not being thrown out of the image in any way despite the fact that your subject is partially out of the frame.', '2011-06-23 19:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451143, 957945, 59796, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet this got a lot of "Cute" comments :)<br/>Hope that bottle only had water and hope there are no PETA Nazis on the board to come after you :D<br/>Very nice concept, well executed. Very neat dark background although the shot''s clearly taken outdoors. <br/> <br/>There''s a bit of a dark green smudge on the top right corner of the pic. Not noticeable enough, but if you want to blow it up or print it, it might become more noticeable.</td>', 'I''ll bet this got a lot of "Cute" comments :)Hope that bottle only had water and hope there are no PETA Nazis on the board to come after you :DVery nice concept, well executed. Very neat dark background although the shot''s clearly taken outdoors.  There''s a bit of a dark green smudge on the top right corner of the pic. Not noticeable enough, but if you want to blow it up or print it, it might become more noticeable.', '2011-06-23 19:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451144, 957683, 132996, '<td valign="top">Very good photograph. I like the pun. I''m unsure why the trees are so clear in the background, though. My eyes are directed there because of the direction of the bottle. You also have a rogue stick. I absolutely love the brightness of the bottle and the reflection in the water. I think the image would be improved with a crop which didn''t include the trees, however, so the viewer can pay more attention to the lights in the bottle and the reflection. The color you captured in the water is phenomenal. There''s a nice blue/purple to hunter green to moss green gradient going on with dabs of red and yellow which is very pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'Very good photograph. I like the pun. I''m unsure why the trees are so clear in the background, though. My eyes are directed there because of the direction of the bottle. You also have a rogue stick. I absolutely love the brightness of the bottle and the reflection in the water. I think the image would be improved with a crop which didn''t include the trees, however, so the viewer can pay more attention to the lights in the bottle and the reflection. The color you captured in the water is phenomenal. There''s a nice blue/purple to hunter green to moss green gradient going on with dabs of red and yellow which is very pleasing to the eye.', '2011-06-23 19:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451148, 957967, 132996, '<td valign="top">I love your take on the challenge. You definitely get kudos for your creativity. I wish the cut was a little more exact and clear, but for concept sake, I think the viewer can forgive you for it. My eyes are being thrown haphazardly around the photo...maybe the potatoes need to be arranged in a way so they point more towards the center (some of the ones on the right are, though, which is good). There''s also some white thing on the right, near the top of the outline...I probably wouldn''t have noticed it though if I wasn''t studying so closely. Again, amazing idea.</td>', 'I love your take on the challenge. You definitely get kudos for your creativity. I wish the cut was a little more exact and clear, but for concept sake, I think the viewer can forgive you for it. My eyes are being thrown haphazardly around the photo...maybe the potatoes need to be arranged in a way so they point more towards the center (some of the ones on the right are, though, which is good). There''s also some white thing on the right, near the top of the outline...I probably wouldn''t have noticed it though if I wasn''t studying so closely. Again, amazing idea.', '2011-06-23 19:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451151, 957433, 132996, '<td valign="top">I love the personification in this. It has a lot more dynamic than just a standard, center-composed, portrait. I love how you cleverly placed the complementing colors of the smaller bottles next to each other...that attention to detail is what makes an image like this so pleasing to view.</td>', 'I love the personification in this. It has a lot more dynamic than just a standard, center-composed, portrait. I love how you cleverly placed the complementing colors of the smaller bottles next to each other...that attention to detail is what makes an image like this so pleasing to view.', '2011-06-23 19:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451154, 957753, 132996, '<td valign="top">This was expertly executed. The post-process really adds to the softness of the idea. The curves of the bottle are accentuated and further softened. I also love the dynamic the hard edges of the wings added to the image. The image would have been a bit boring if the feathers were soft. Great coupling of yellow and blue also. My only complaint would be that there''s a bit too much negative space on the bottom and left of the image. The centerpiece is in a bit of an awkward place. Perhaps a tighter crop would help.</td>', 'This was expertly executed. The post-process really adds to the softness of the idea. The curves of the bottle are accentuated and further softened. I also love the dynamic the hard edges of the wings added to the image. The image would have been a bit boring if the feathers were soft. Great coupling of yellow and blue also. My only complaint would be that there''s a bit too much negative space on the bottom and left of the image. The centerpiece is in a bit of an awkward place. Perhaps a tighter crop would help.', '2011-06-23 19:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451156, 957936, 132996, '<td valign="top">Absinthe! The green is so vibrant in this image. I also love the ivy creeping around. I would love it even more if it came even further around the neck of the bottle. I like the addition of the glass...however if this was an ad, I think the jagged edges of the glass would disturb the viewer too much. The jagged edges are too obviously evil. A normal glass would be the angel with devil horns in my opinion. I still love your use of green and the back-lighting is perfect. The ivy really keeps the viewer on the subject.</td>', 'Absinthe! The green is so vibrant in this image. I also love the ivy creeping around. I would love it even more if it came even further around the neck of the bottle. I like the addition of the glass...however if this was an ad, I think the jagged edges of the glass would disturb the viewer too much. The jagged edges are too obviously evil. A normal glass would be the angel with devil horns in my opinion. I still love your use of green and the back-lighting is perfect. The ivy really keeps the viewer on the subject.', '2011-06-23 19:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451157, 957306, 132996, '<td valign="top">I think what your saying here is that Absolut vodka makes you manly enough to score the babe? I like the idea very much. It has very good market value. I think your execution is poor though. The subjects are blurry and your location is scary and kind of gross. The idea definitely deserves a revisit.</td>', 'I think what your saying here is that Absolut vodka makes you manly enough to score the babe? I like the idea very much. It has very good market value. I think your execution is poor though. The subjects are blurry and your location is scary and kind of gross. The idea definitely deserves a revisit.', '2011-06-23 20:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451160, 957780, 132996, '<td valign="top">The execution of this photo is great. The image is clear, the contrast is great, and the colors are vibrant. The back-lighting is creating a very nice blue vignette. It''s a standard ad. It would do better with a little idea, concept, and pizazz to excite the viewer. Perhaps your idea is "cool." I''m taking it to mean "cold." What if everything was on ice? That would really bring the idea of "cool" more to the forefront and excite more people to quench their thirst.</td>', 'The execution of this photo is great. The image is clear, the contrast is great, and the colors are vibrant. The back-lighting is creating a very nice blue vignette. It''s a standard ad. It would do better with a little idea, concept, and pizazz to excite the viewer. Perhaps your idea is "cool." I''m taking it to mean "cold." What if everything was on ice? That would really bring the idea of "cool" more to the forefront and excite more people to quench their thirst.', '2011-06-23 20:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451167, 957987, 132996, '<td valign="top">Great image. The colors are very diverse in their shades. I don''t like the vignette, though. I''m not necessarily being thrown out of the image with anything; the colors in the water are so soft and curling that they aren''t pointing me anywhere or anything...so I think the vignette is adding unnecessary grays to the image (maybe a bit lighter vignette would be a bit more appropriate). I love the shades of orange, red and magenta happening here. It partly reminds me of blood...but then I see the slight purple and I don''t even consider it at first glance. This was very clever. I don''t think vodka drinkers want to (at least when sober) mix blood and vodka! Very good image.</td>', 'Great image. The colors are very diverse in their shades. I don''t like the vignette, though. I''m not necessarily being thrown out of the image with anything; the colors in the water are so soft and curling that they aren''t pointing me anywhere or anything...so I think the vignette is adding unnecessary grays to the image (maybe a bit lighter vignette would be a bit more appropriate). I love the shades of orange, red and magenta happening here. It partly reminds me of blood...but then I see the slight purple and I don''t even consider it at first glance. This was very clever. I don''t think vodka drinkers want to (at least when sober) mix blood and vodka! Very good image.', '2011-06-23 20:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451171, 957420, 132996, '<td valign="top">I love your idea here. The orange lighting is adding such a nice color and complementing the blues in the bottle beautifully (which could be a bit stronger, possibly). I wish it wasn''t so top-weighted though. I think shifting the bottle down to closer to the bottom of the frame and extending the lightning higher would create a more pleasant composition. The lightning (which it is also doing now) would pull the viewer''s eyes to the bottle beautifully.</td>', 'I love your idea here. The orange lighting is adding such a nice color and complementing the blues in the bottle beautifully (which could be a bit stronger, possibly). I wish it wasn''t so top-weighted though. I think shifting the bottle down to closer to the bottom of the frame and extending the lightning higher would create a more pleasant composition. The lightning (which it is also doing now) would pull the viewer''s eyes to the bottle beautifully.', '2011-06-23 20:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451178, 957892, 59796, '<td valign="top">Very cool concept! Love the minimalistic feel as well. <br/>I even like the obvious imperfections/dents around the bottle as they show it''s a shot and not a photoshop trick. I still can''t figure out how you shot this :) Nicely done.</td>', 'Very cool concept! Love the minimalistic feel as well. I even like the obvious imperfections/dents around the bottle as they show it''s a shot and not a photoshop trick. I still can''t figure out how you shot this :) Nicely done.', '2011-06-23 20:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451179, 957468, 59796, '<td valign="top">Neat! The misty smooth water and the soft light make this shot. <br/>Not too crazy about the glistening rock in the foreground though - it''s competing for attention with the bottle itself I think.</td>', 'Neat! The misty smooth water and the soft light make this shot. Not too crazy about the glistening rock in the foreground though - it''s competing for attention with the bottle itself I think.', '2011-06-23 20:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451182, 957317, 59796, '<td valign="top">Great idea! Very nicely done without the bottle itself - sets itself apart from the other shots. My top 5.<br/>The top left area is a little less dense with pins than other areas of the pic - I guess you must''ve been running out of patience by then :)</td>', 'Great idea! Very nicely done without the bottle itself - sets itself apart from the other shots. My top 5.The top left area is a little less dense with pins than other areas of the pic - I guess you must''ve been running out of patience by then :)', '2011-06-23 20:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451185, 957785, 132996, '<td valign="top">I''m liking your concept here. I think your fake blood looks completely fake though. It''s way too magenta. Perhaps pulling in more orange in post-process would have been better (and it would have complemented the blue nicely). I do commend you for stepping outside of the typical vodka bottle portrait. The blood and tooth definitely adds interest. The reflection is nice, though the blood reflection is pulling the viewer''s eyes out of the image a bit. I like the vignette the back-light has generated; I think it adds a darker feel to your image.</td>', 'I''m liking your concept here. I think your fake blood looks completely fake though. It''s way too magenta. Perhaps pulling in more orange in post-process would have been better (and it would have complemented the blue nicely). I do commend you for stepping outside of the typical vodka bottle portrait. The blood and tooth definitely adds interest. The reflection is nice, though the blood reflection is pulling the viewer''s eyes out of the image a bit. I like the vignette the back-light has generated; I think it adds a darker feel to your image.', '2011-06-23 20:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451191, 957586, 59796, '<td valign="top">Cool concept and title. Did you cut a hole in the stopper and stir it? Very cool however you did it.<br/> <br/>The lighting''s almost there, but not quite I feel. The blown out highlights at the neck of the bottle are competing for attention and it needed me to look at the title before I actually saw the tornado in the picture.</td>', 'Cool concept and title. Did you cut a hole in the stopper and stir it? Very cool however you did it. The lighting''s almost there, but not quite I feel. The blown out highlights at the neck of the bottle are competing for attention and it needed me to look at the title before I actually saw the tornado in the picture.', '2011-06-23 20:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451196, 957466, 18778, '<td valign="top">The bottle is beautifully lit &amp; I like the way the props frame the primary subject.  Speaking of props- the Clue concept is competing for my attention.</td>', 'The bottle is beautifully lit & I like the way the props frame the primary subject.  Speaking of props- the Clue concept is competing for my attention.', '2011-06-23 20:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
