(6451235, 957586, 18778, '<td valign="top">I''m not a huge fan of the ''floating bottle'' look. I do appreciate the creative idea &amp; I also like the the lighting.  However, I wish the tornado wasn''t competing with the words on the bottle.  Perhaps the words could have been made a touch bolder in post processing?</td>', 'I''m not a huge fan of the ''floating bottle'' look. I do appreciate the creative idea & I also like the the lighting.  However, I wish the tornado wasn''t competing with the words on the bottle.  Perhaps the words could have been made a touch bolder in post processing?', '2011-06-23 21:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
