(6451292, 957522, 133612, '<td valign="top">a nice idea, just lost a few points for the lighting of the bottle as it seemed quite harsh. if you could have found a way for the whole bottle to "glow" and somehow make the shadows look like the light was coming from the bottle i think it would be much improved.</td>', 'a nice idea, just lost a few points for the lighting of the bottle as it seemed quite harsh. if you could have found a way for the whole bottle to "glow" and somehow make the shadows look like the light was coming from the bottle i think it would be much improved.', '2011-06-23 23:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6451293, 957638, 133612, '<td valign="top">haha man i look at this shot and it reminds me of the old ads in my playboy magazines from the 70s! if i flip the page i expect to see an ad for houndstooth flared suits, kool cigarettes, or a datsun sunny. very nice, ill be interested in your method!</td>', 'haha man i look at this shot and it reminds me of the old ads in my playboy magazines from the 70s! if i flip the page i expect to see an ad for houndstooth flared suits, kool cigarettes, or a datsun sunny. very nice, ill be interested in your method!', '2011-06-23 23:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
