(6451996, 957967, 58634, '<td valign="top">The idea is excellent and very creative.. But you could''ve done a better job with cutting them and aligning them properly.</td>', 'The idea is excellent and very creative.. But you could''ve done a better job with cutting them and aligning them properly.', '2011-06-24 18:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
