(6452384, 957727, 58634, '<td valign="top">The light seems very bright. I would''ve prefered for a more open crop, and for the "Absolut" to be in focus. <br/> <br/>I''m not DNMC-ing you, (and won''t vote less because of it) but I would like to point out that the challenge did call for a bottle or bottle shape to be captured.. But anyway. <br/> <br/>What I do like about this, is the fact that the droplets are in focus, and when I really think about it, this is not such an easy shot to capture. Bumping you up.</td>', 'The light seems very bright. I would''ve prefered for a more open crop, and for the "Absolut" to be in focus.  I''m not DNMC-ing you, (and won''t vote less because of it) but I would like to point out that the challenge did call for a bottle or bottle shape to be captured.. But anyway.  What I do like about this, is the fact that the droplets are in focus, and when I really think about it, this is not such an easy shot to capture. Bumping you up.', '2011-06-25 14:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6452385, 957968, 58634, '<td valign="top">The POV is a bit off to the side, and it bothers me slightly. The botttle is in perfect focus which is good, but I would''ve liked a more shallow depth of field to maybe create a bit of a bokeh effect with some nice colors shining through the bottle.</td>', 'The POV is a bit off to the side, and it bothers me slightly. The botttle is in perfect focus which is good, but I would''ve liked a more shallow depth of field to maybe create a bit of a bokeh effect with some nice colors shining through the bottle.', '2011-06-25 14:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6452386, 957894, 58634, '<td valign="top">I''m a bit confused about the title fitting the picture, but maybe I''m just missing something. I like the different textures that are through the picture, and the rough feel it''s got to it. <br/> <br/>I''m not a fan of the border though. <br/>Bumping you up a point.</td>', 'I''m a bit confused about the title fitting the picture, but maybe I''m just missing something. I like the different textures that are through the picture, and the rough feel it''s got to it.  I''m not a fan of the border though. Bumping you up a point.', '2011-06-25 14:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6452387, 957712, 58634, '<td valign="top">I see that you have writing in the corks. I wish the image was brighter so that we could see more clearly what they say. It could add a special feel to it. Also, if you would''ve linked the writings on the corks, with what''s ''inside'' the bottle, the image would''ve been a bit more interesting. <br/> <br/>I like the colors of the leaves though.</td>', 'I see that you have writing in the corks. I wish the image was brighter so that we could see more clearly what they say. It could add a special feel to it. Also, if you would''ve linked the writings on the corks, with what''s ''inside'' the bottle, the image would''ve been a bit more interesting.  I like the colors of the leaves though.', '2011-06-25 14:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6452388, 957956, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of crop.</td>', 'I like your choice of crop.', '2011-06-25 14:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6452390, 957981, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like the nice, crisp, focusing and the fact that the rose looks so velvety.</td>', 'I like the nice, crisp, focusing and the fact that the rose looks so velvety.', '2011-06-25 14:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6452478, 957982, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is the winner! Lighting is perfect and I''m dying to know how you did this!!!!<br/> <br/>I keep coming back to this to try and figure it out. My best guess is that you have a very strong fan blowing on the bottle and that is forcing the water that is pouring out of the bottle to be blown back.</td>', 'This is the winner! Lighting is perfect and I''m dying to know how you did this!!!! I keep coming back to this to try and figure it out. My best guess is that you have a very strong fan blowing on the bottle and that is forcing the water that is pouring out of the bottle to be blown back.', '2011-06-25 18:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6452677, 957468, 18778, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image.  The softness of the mist contrasting with the shiny, very definitive texture of the rocks.  It does have a certain ''magical'' tome to it.</td>', 'This is a beautiful image.  The softness of the mist contrasting with the shiny, very definitive texture of the rocks.  It does have a certain ''magical'' tome to it.', '2011-06-26 01:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6452679, 957712, 18778, '<td valign="top">I dig the idea- but I''m wishing the outline of the bottle was closer absolut silhouette...seeing as the absolute bottle is so distinct.</td>', 'I dig the idea- but I''m wishing the outline of the bottle was closer absolut silhouette...seeing as the absolute bottle is so distinct.', '2011-06-26 01:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
