(6452910, 957979, 58634, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture. I like the black bakground, too. And the fact that the shot glass is the same hue of blue as the "ABSOLUT VODKA" logo. I don''t know if this would make for a good advertisement for Absolut, but the image isn''t bad. My critique is that the bottles almost seem slanted to the left.</td>', 'Very nice picture. I like the black bakground, too. And the fact that the shot glass is the same hue of blue as the "ABSOLUT VODKA" logo. I don''t know if this would make for a good advertisement for Absolut, but the image isn''t bad. My critique is that the bottles almost seem slanted to the left.', '2011-06-26 14:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
