(6452977, 957586, 58634, '<td valign="top">The lighting is really harsh at the center, but the ''tornado'' effect is pretty cool. Originally I gave you a 5, but I''m bumping you to a 7.</td>', 'The lighting is really harsh at the center, but the ''tornado'' effect is pretty cool. Originally I gave you a 5, but I''m bumping you to a 7.', '2011-06-26 15:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6452978, 957458, 58634, '<td valign="top">Idea is great, I just wish the bottle didn''t wash out so much due to the lighting. I can barely even tell it says "ABSOLUT VODKA".</td>', 'Idea is great, I just wish the bottle didn''t wash out so much due to the lighting. I can barely even tell it says "ABSOLUT VODKA".', '2011-06-26 15:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
