(6452984, 957598, 58634, '<td valign="top">When I first voted, I didn''t realize how absolutely EXCELLENT the lighting in this image is. The bottle looks fabulous and it was actually exactly what I wanted MY bottle to look like in the entry for this challenge. I would love it if you''d share tips on how you achieved this. <br/> <br/>With that said, I''m not a big fan of the sun being part of the picture, in my opinion it makes it slightly awkward. However, I do like how you lit the sun ''orange'' while still keeping the rest of the image ''white''.<br/> <br/>Bumping you up a couple of points.</td>', 'When I first voted, I didn''t realize how absolutely EXCELLENT the lighting in this image is. The bottle looks fabulous and it was actually exactly what I wanted MY bottle to look like in the entry for this challenge. I would love it if you''d share tips on how you achieved this.  With that said, I''m not a big fan of the sun being part of the picture, in my opinion it makes it slightly awkward. However, I do like how you lit the sun ''orange'' while still keeping the rest of the image ''white''. Bumping you up a couple of points.', '2011-06-26 15:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
