(6453016, 957751, 58634, '<td valign="top">This is probably my favorite in this challenge. It''s diferent. I am not entirely sure I understand the title, but I like the creative take on the ''ad''.  The strong contrast and blue hue really works to your advantage.</td>', 'This is probably my favorite in this challenge. It''s diferent. I am not entirely sure I understand the title, but I like the creative take on the ''ad''.  The strong contrast and blue hue really works to your advantage.', '2011-06-26 15:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453017, 957420, 58634, '<td valign="top">I love this. My only small critique is the cropping. I would''ve preferred the vertical crop of this, or at least not so square, but it''s minimal. It must''ve taken you a lot of shots to achieve this!</td>', 'I love this. My only small critique is the cropping. I would''ve preferred the vertical crop of this, or at least not so square, but it''s minimal. It must''ve taken you a lot of shots to achieve this!', '2011-06-26 15:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453018, 957986, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like how sharp and clear the image is. The bottle is empty, which is very noticeable to me but I don''t think it particularly hurts the image. Just an observation. I like the colors in the sky, and how beautiful they look against the bottle.</td>', 'I like how sharp and clear the image is. The bottle is empty, which is very noticeable to me but I don''t think it particularly hurts the image. Just an observation. I like the colors in the sky, and how beautiful they look against the bottle.', '2011-06-26 15:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453019, 957987, 58634, '<td valign="top">Definitely a cool idea! I like it a lot. I wish you would''ve included a bit more color, or maybe less white (cropped differently) in the picture but this definitely works for me.</td>', 'Definitely a cool idea! I like it a lot. I wish you would''ve included a bit more color, or maybe less white (cropped differently) in the picture but this definitely works for me.', '2011-06-26 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453020, 957936, 58634, '<td valign="top">I really like how some of the leaves are in a silhouette while some are lit. I like the green color too. Excellent job.</td>', 'I really like how some of the leaves are in a silhouette while some are lit. I like the green color too. Excellent job.', '2011-06-26 15:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453021, 957785, 58634, '<td valign="top">The bottle''s reflection doesn''t seem straight to me which bothers me, but I love the picture itself. Unique and simplistic. The lighting is very well execute and that''s hard to do with reflective items! lol</td>', 'The bottle''s reflection doesn''t seem straight to me which bothers me, but I love the picture itself. Unique and simplistic. The lighting is very well execute and that''s hard to do with reflective items! lol', '2011-06-26 15:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453022, 957582, 58634, '<td valign="top">The title of your image throws me off, however I like the picture itself. It was creative to include more than one bottle. The lighting is a bit harsh, especially since some areas are very light, and some dark (bottle caps) but the contrast it gives works to give the image a bit of a pop!</td>', 'The title of your image throws me off, however I like the picture itself. It was creative to include more than one bottle. The lighting is a bit harsh, especially since some areas are very light, and some dark (bottle caps) but the contrast it gives works to give the image a bit of a pop!', '2011-06-26 15:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453025, 957986, 120129, '<td valign="top">love this. colors, dof, creativity, and especially love the horizon displacement in the bottle.</td>', 'love this. colors, dof, creativity, and especially love the horizon displacement in the bottle.', '2011-06-26 16:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453026, 957915, 120129, '<td valign="top">wow...nicely done!</td>', 'wow...nicely done!', '2011-06-26 16:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453052, 957967, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. I wonder how many people really know that vodka comes from potatoes.<br/> <br/>I''m sure you have heard this already, but the upper right of the bottle being broken is hurting this otherwise clean image.</td>', 'Cute idea. I wonder how many people really know that vodka comes from potatoes. I''m sure you have heard this already, but the upper right of the bottle being broken is hurting this otherwise clean image.', '2011-06-26 17:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453053, 957586, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool. I missed the tornado at first look, really had to study it a bit. If you are getting lower scores, I wonder if that could be the problem.</td>', 'Very cool. I missed the tornado at first look, really had to study it a bit. If you are getting lower scores, I wonder if that could be the problem.', '2011-06-26 17:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453054, 957990, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very basic image. Seems like it could go well on top of a cool background. But the all black is a bit boring and hurting the overall photo for me.</td>', 'Very basic image. Seems like it could go well on top of a cool background. But the all black is a bit boring and hurting the overall photo for me.', '2011-06-26 17:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453055, 957894, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m really enjoying the processing on this. I''m sure some people are thinking it is overdone, but I like the gritty feel with the scene.</td>', 'I''m really enjoying the processing on this. I''m sure some people are thinking it is overdone, but I like the gritty feel with the scene.', '2011-06-26 17:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453057, 957514, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m not so sure I like the blue light come from the right. I that doesn''t seem to be used to highlight anything.</td>', 'I''m not so sure I like the blue light come from the right. I that doesn''t seem to be used to highlight anything.', '2011-06-26 17:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453059, 957683, 114225, '<td valign="top">Gorgeously done.  I''m 15% of the way through voting and this is the first image that I think could actually be used in an ad.</td>', 'Gorgeously done.  I''m 15% of the way through voting and this is the first image that I think could actually be used in an ad.', '2011-06-26 17:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453060, 957956, 114225, '<td valign="top">Lovely setup. I really like the idea of vodka as the sun sets on a warm summer day.</td>', 'Lovely setup. I really like the idea of vodka as the sun sets on a warm summer day.', '2011-06-26 17:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453061, 957985, 114225, '<td valign="top">Without the title, it''s pretty tough to see that this is a treasure box. I think it would have been a much better shot if there were gold coins and jewelry spilling out of the box rather than seaweed.</td>', 'Without the title, it''s pretty tough to see that this is a treasure box. I think it would have been a much better shot if there were gold coins and jewelry spilling out of the box rather than seaweed.', '2011-06-26 17:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453062, 957986, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m very much enjoying the combination of colors in this scene, especially how the bulb at the base of the bottle is refracting the blue sky.</td>', 'I''m very much enjoying the combination of colors in this scene, especially how the bulb at the base of the bottle is refracting the blue sky.', '2011-06-26 17:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453063, 957773, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like this setup. The blue lit water really works well to offset from the yellow of the city lights.</td>', 'I like this setup. The blue lit water really works well to offset from the yellow of the city lights.', '2011-06-26 17:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453064, 957935, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a cool photo, although I don''t know about the use of an advertisement. I would think a company would be leery of showing off their product as radioactive.</td>', 'This is a cool photo, although I don''t know about the use of an advertisement. I would think a company would be leery of showing off their product as radioactive.', '2011-06-26 17:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453070, 957780, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully done. This looks like what one would see in a magazine.</td>', 'Wonderfully done. This looks like what one would see in a magazine.', '2011-06-26 17:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453073, 957972, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like what you were going for here, but really wish I could see more of the bottle.</td>', 'I like what you were going for here, but really wish I could see more of the bottle.', '2011-06-26 17:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453074, 957946, 114225, '<td valign="top">Creative idea. The paper bottle looks very convincing.</td>', 'Creative idea. The paper bottle looks very convincing.', '2011-06-26 17:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453075, 957977, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love this!!  Truly worthy of an ad in a glossy magazine.  My fav so far.</td>', 'I love this!!  Truly worthy of an ad in a glossy magazine.  My fav so far.', '2011-06-26 17:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453076, 957945, 114225, '<td valign="top">You have these squirrels trained to do your bidding, don''t you? :)</td>', 'You have these squirrels trained to do your bidding, don''t you? :)', '2011-06-26 17:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6453077, 957987, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea. Something I could have never though of. It works well.</td>', 'Very cool idea. Something I could have never though of. It works well.', '2011-06-26 17:23:23.000000', NULL, 1);
