(6454430, 957727, 99140, '<td valign="top">Slightly confused - looks like it is mixed with sprite? but in a Coca-cola glass plus the coca-cola is clearer to read than then Absolute - still a nice pic - 6</td>', 'Slightly confused - looks like it is mixed with sprite? but in a Coca-cola glass plus the coca-cola is clearer to read than then Absolute - still a nice pic - 6', '2011-06-27 21:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
