(6455024, 957935, 59796, '<td valign="top">Unusual Lighting and color, compared to rest of the pics in the challenge. High points for originality there. I like the concept and goes well with the title. The only thing mildly distracting is the loss of detail just below the logo and just above the large ABSOLUT print. Seems like a blown out portion recovered?</td>', 'Unusual Lighting and color, compared to rest of the pics in the challenge. High points for originality there. I like the concept and goes well with the title. The only thing mildly distracting is the loss of detail just below the logo and just above the large ABSOLUT print. Seems like a blown out portion recovered?', '2011-06-28 18:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455027, 957785, 30861, '<td valign="top">Most bizarre "classic" one ever...</td>', 'Most bizarre "classic" one ever...', '2011-06-28 18:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455035, 957420, 59796, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting on the bottle, and creative wiggles around it. <br/> <br/>The two long wiggles on the top left are distracting quite a bit from the bottle. A closer crop to cut them out would improve the picture quite a bit I think.<br/> <br/>Also, the double reflection on the bottom from the glass mirror is a little bit jarring. A single reflection from a plastic board should improve that and make it a perfect pic.</td>', 'Excellent lighting on the bottle, and creative wiggles around it.  The two long wiggles on the top left are distracting quite a bit from the bottle. A closer crop to cut them out would improve the picture quite a bit I think. Also, the double reflection on the bottom from the glass mirror is a little bit jarring. A single reflection from a plastic board should improve that and make it a perfect pic.', '2011-06-28 19:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455039, 957946, 59796, '<td valign="top">Ha! Nice concept. I would''ve gone with another vodka company instead of a beer company as the imposter, but a nice concept nonetheless.</td>', 'Ha! Nice concept. I would''ve gone with another vodka company instead of a beer company as the imposter, but a nice concept nonetheless.', '2011-06-28 19:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455041, 957582, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, execution and lighting.<br/> <br/>2 minor details keep it from perfect:<br/>1. There''s a slight slant in the pic. The right inverted bottle is chopped off a little bit at the top, whereas the left inverted bottle is intact.<br/>2. The dark reflection on the right most bottle is distracting.</td>', 'Nice concept, execution and lighting. 2 minor details keep it from perfect:1. There''s a slight slant in the pic. The right inverted bottle is chopped off a little bit at the top, whereas the left inverted bottle is intact.2. The dark reflection on the right most bottle is distracting.', '2011-06-28 19:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455044, 957785, 59796, '<td valign="top">LOL.. I''m sure Italians would be up in the arms over such gross interpretation of "Al Dente" :)<br/> <br/>Nice picture (although a bit on the gross side ;)<br/>Fantastic lighting. No distracting reflections on the bottle itself, and a nice, clear reflection on the bottom. Well done.</td>', 'LOL.. I''m sure Italians would be up in the arms over such gross interpretation of "Al Dente" :) Nice picture (although a bit on the gross side ;)Fantastic lighting. No distracting reflections on the bottle itself, and a nice, clear reflection on the bottom. Well done.', '2011-06-28 19:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455049, 957753, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is pretty much flawless. It''s a little cloying for my taste but I''ve little doubt it will ribbon.</td>', 'This is pretty much flawless. It''s a little cloying for my taste but I''ve little doubt it will ribbon.', '2011-06-28 19:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455050, 957982, 30861, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah, there''s another ribbon!</td>', 'Oh yeah, there''s another ribbon!', '2011-06-28 19:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455052, 957936, 59796, '<td valign="top">Cool concept and unusual color - goes well with the title. No direct light on the ivy makes sense - otherwise it would be distracting. The only thing I would probably change is to make sure the Absolut bottle is not smack in the center of the pic. Nice concept and execution.</td>', 'Cool concept and unusual color - goes well with the title. No direct light on the ivy makes sense - otherwise it would be distracting. The only thing I would probably change is to make sure the Absolut bottle is not smack in the center of the pic. Nice concept and execution.', '2011-06-28 19:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455053, 957638, 117534, '<td valign="top">This really would make a great ad!</td>', 'This really would make a great ad!', '2011-06-28 19:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455054, 957945, 117534, '<td valign="top">Absolut Cuteness to the inth degree!! Did he get a buzz?</td>', 'Absolut Cuteness to the inth degree!! Did he get a buzz?', '2011-06-28 19:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455058, 957780, 59796, '<td valign="top">Very nice and cool lighting. No distracting reflections on the bottle and glass themselves - that''s awesome. The bottom however, is quite jarring because of the double reflection - I''m guessing you used a glass mirror?</td>', 'Very nice and cool lighting. No distracting reflections on the bottle and glass themselves - that''s awesome. The bottom however, is quite jarring because of the double reflection - I''m guessing you used a glass mirror?', '2011-06-28 19:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455081, 957977, 59796, '<td valign="top">Delightful color gradient - goes well with the title. Love the minimalistic concept as well. I would''ve probably liked it even more if there was more negative space and the bottle were not in the center.</td>', 'Delightful color gradient - goes well with the title. Love the minimalistic concept as well. I would''ve probably liked it even more if there was more negative space and the bottle were not in the center.', '2011-06-28 19:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455090, 957712, 59796, '<td valign="top">Wonderful concept and execution. You must be down under to find autumn leaves now :)<br/>Would''ve liked it even more if the closest corks were also in focus.</td>', 'Wonderful concept and execution. You must be down under to find autumn leaves now :)Would''ve liked it even more if the closest corks were also in focus.', '2011-06-28 19:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455093, 957911, 59796, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea - using a reflection to make a bottle whole again. If the light were a bit more flat, it would''ve worked even better I think - the dark shadows in the water are a little bit distracting.</td>', 'Very nice idea - using a reflection to make a bottle whole again. If the light were a bit more flat, it would''ve worked even better I think - the dark shadows in the water are a little bit distracting.', '2011-06-28 19:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455098, 957190, 59796, '<td valign="top">A very unique bottle. Good lighting and reflection too. I think I would''ve liked a little bit more light from the front - the slight shadow dang in the middle of the bottle front is a little bit distracting. For a glass bottle I would understand why people won''t do that, but for a non reflective surface like this one I would avoid shadows.</td>', 'A very unique bottle. Good lighting and reflection too. I think I would''ve liked a little bit more light from the front - the slight shadow dang in the middle of the bottle front is a little bit distracting. For a glass bottle I would understand why people won''t do that, but for a non reflective surface like this one I would avoid shadows.', '2011-06-28 19:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
