(6455281, 957985, 18778, '<td valign="top">With this title- I''m really wanting to see some sparkly, shiny objects in this image. With out the title, I''m not sure I would have distinguished a treasure box from this image.  I like the proportions of your subjects in this shot and the colors are appealing.  In fact, I''m surprised at how well the white bottle shows up here! I also like the texture of the sand contrasted with the smoothness of the bottle.</td>', 'With this title- I''m really wanting to see some sparkly, shiny objects in this image. With out the title, I''m not sure I would have distinguished a treasure box from this image.  I like the proportions of your subjects in this shot and the colors are appealing.  In fact, I''m surprised at how well the white bottle shows up here! I also like the texture of the sand contrasted with the smoothness of the bottle.', '2011-06-29 00:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455282, 957785, 18778, '<td valign="top">Title alone- pasta is the first thing that comes to mind.  Should I be implying a pun?  A crisp, clear image that is beautifully lit.  The execution here is wonderful. I have such mixed feelings on this piece!  I appreciate the creative effort but I''m super turned off by the mixed ideas of consumption &amp; bloody pain.  Overall, a very memorable image.</td>', 'Title alone- pasta is the first thing that comes to mind.  Should I be implying a pun?  A crisp, clear image that is beautifully lit.  The execution here is wonderful. I have such mixed feelings on this piece!  I appreciate the creative effort but I''m super turned off by the mixed ideas of consumption & bloody pain.  Overall, a very memorable image.', '2011-06-29 00:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455283, 957785, 125275, '<td valign="top">I''m holding out for this as the winner. Who wants to wait to open the bottle to drink their vodka? *CHOMP*</td>', 'I''m holding out for this as the winner. Who wants to wait to open the bottle to drink their vodka? *CHOMP*', '2011-06-29 00:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455285, 957753, 125275, '<td valign="top">I love the softness of this, as well as the placement of the bottles. This is so well executed. The bottles really appear to be floating in space. The idea is wonderful, execution wonderful. Very nice job.</td>', 'I love the softness of this, as well as the placement of the bottles. This is so well executed. The bottles really appear to be floating in space. The idea is wonderful, execution wonderful. Very nice job.', '2011-06-29 00:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6455286, 957977, 125275, '<td valign="top">I can''t explain what I like about this so much, but it''s definitely what of my most highly rated. I love it.</td>', 'I can''t explain what I like about this so much, but it''s definitely what of my most highly rated. I love it.', '2011-06-29 00:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
