(6455301, 957915, 18778, '<td valign="top">The only entry in this challenge to take an angle like this.  The lighting is beautiful- feels like the bottle is escaping from the sun.  Beautiful. No implications on my vote- but I really wish the safety wrapper had been removed.</td>', 'The only entry in this challenge to take an angle like this.  The lighting is beautiful- feels like the bottle is escaping from the sun.  Beautiful. No implications on my vote- but I really wish the safety wrapper had been removed.', '2011-06-29 00:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
