(6455773, 957982, 103048, '<td valign="top">This is awesome stuff. And I especially appreciate your comments about strategic low voting. While my work is nowhere near this in quality, I too have sat back and often wondered when fairly decent images have had unreasonably low votes.<br/> <br/>That said, I''d be hard pressed to see why anyone would vote less than a perfect 10 on this. The only reasonable comment I see is from someone marking it down due to an extra glass (the one at the bottom). <br/> <br/>Great job - both from technical and photographic aspect!</td>', 'This is awesome stuff. And I especially appreciate your comments about strategic low voting. While my work is nowhere near this in quality, I too have sat back and often wondered when fairly decent images have had unreasonably low votes. That said, I''d be hard pressed to see why anyone would vote less than a perfect 10 on this. The only reasonable comment I see is from someone marking it down due to an extra glass (the one at the bottom).  Great job - both from technical and photographic aspect!', '2011-06-29 11:56:20.000000', NULL, 0),
