(6455871, 957945, 19825, '<td valign="top">Great job on this shot -- it should have placed higher. It is very well executed and simply hilarious. I admire your patience. Fifteen votes below a 4 -- that is Absolut Silliness!</td>', 'Great job on this shot -- it should have placed higher. It is very well executed and simply hilarious. I admire your patience. Fifteen votes below a 4 -- that is Absolut Silliness!', '2011-06-29 13:39:53.000000', NULL, 0);
