(6456034, 957982, 59796, '<td valign="top">Thought quite a bit, and still can''t figure out how I would do such a shot...<br/> <br/>Congratulations on a stellar score! This amazing shot deserves it.<br/></td>', 'Thought quite a bit, and still can''t figure out how I would do such a shot... Congratulations on a stellar score! This amazing shot deserves it.', '2011-06-29 17:18:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6456037, 957982, 133722, '<td valign="top">Fantastic picture.  I didn''t vote this round, but I would have given it a ten.  After reading how much you spent on the set up, I think I may know how you did it (or at least another way it could be done.)  Very creative.  Congrats.</td>', 'Fantastic picture.  I didn''t vote this round, but I would have given it a ten.  After reading how much you spent on the set up, I think I may know how you did it (or at least another way it could be done.)  Very creative.  Congrats.', '2011-06-29 17:25:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(6456038, 957982, 93714, '<td valign="top">I just finished doing a straight product shot on a vodka bottle and that was tough enough.  This is an incredible shot and I can''t imagine anyone voting less than a 9 regardless of their <u>envy factor</u>.  This would get a major ad payday in anyone''s bag of tricks.  I don''t care what app, or program you used, it''s a fantastict concept, shot and editing job... well done, you deserve 1st. place on this!!!<br/>Frank</td>', 'I just finished doing a straight product shot on a vodka bottle and that was tough enough.  This is an incredible shot and I can''t imagine anyone voting less than a 9 regardless of their envy factor.  This would get a major ad payday in anyone''s bag of tricks.  I don''t care what app, or program you used, it''s a fantastict concept, shot and editing job... well done, you deserve 1st. place on this!!!Frank', '2011-06-29 17:25:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(6456039, 957753, 133722, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Congrats!</td>', 'Beautiful.  Congrats!', '2011-06-29 17:26:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(6456082, 957985, 133612, '<td valign="top">thanks for the comments guys, yes yes, the box is underexposed ;) i took many shots and this was the one with the best light on the subject which i thought was kinda the point of the challenge. i did have "jewels" and a pearl necklace which i lost in a big wave the day earlier! i had other shots with coins in the box, but the bottle had light reflections or other flaws which i felt excluded the pictures.<br/> <br/>resonably happy i guess with my first entry, cheers..</td>', 'thanks for the comments guys, yes yes, the box is underexposed ;) i took many shots and this was the one with the best light on the subject which i thought was kinda the point of the challenge. i did have "jewels" and a pearl necklace which i lost in a big wave the day earlier! i had other shots with coins in the box, but the bottle had light reflections or other flaws which i felt excluded the pictures. resonably happy i guess with my first entry, cheers..', '2011-06-29 18:29:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(6456107, 957982, 119823, '<td valign="top">Unbelievable! Congratulations on amazing score! too bad I didn''t vote on this, have to give up the hint.</td>', 'Unbelievable! Congratulations on amazing score! too bad I didn''t vote on this, have to give up the hint.', '2011-06-29 19:52:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6456115, 957982, 119823, '<td valign="top">Have you ever encountered any multiple-choice in your school exam yet? No wonder you name yourself one2one. I bet "win a ribbon" was not his single purpose of paying $300.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by one2one:</b></div><hr/><i> You scare me with your obsessive behaviour about votes and scoring. Paying 300 dollars to win a ribbon is also obsessive and kind of strange. All for the glory I guess.....<br/> <br/>Your shot is well done but I do not want to know how it was done because for me, this is a hobby that gives me much pleasure and if I were to go all out as you did here I wouldn''t be enjoying myself, it would become tedious and resemble working for a company just like a regular job.<br/> <br/>To each his own.....<br/> <br/>Oh and congratulations on a blue ribbon..... </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Have you ever encountered any multiple-choice in your school exam yet? No wonder you name yourself one2one. I bet "win a ribbon" was not his single purpose of paying $300. Originally posted by one2one: You scare me with your obsessive behaviour about votes and scoring. Paying 300 dollars to win a ribbon is also obsessive and kind of strange. All for the glory I guess..... Your shot is well done but I do not want to know how it was done because for me, this is a hobby that gives me much pleasure and if I were to go all out as you did here I wouldn''t be enjoying myself, it would become tedious and resemble working for a company just like a regular job. To each his own..... Oh and congratulations on a blue ribbon..... ', '2011-06-29 20:04:21.000000', NULL, 0),
