(6660417, 957950, 116649, '<td valign="top">The reason I stopped melting the ice when I did was that the fissure you see on the top left was threatening to crack the whole composition. Many comments about taking the plastic off, though I don''t see how that detracts from the photo.<br/> <br/>What amused me though, and given, if this was a stand-alone exhibit in a gallery all comments would be spot on, was how many mentioned <br/>the lack of visibility of the label.  If you sat and scored in one sitting, did you not have it memorized?  Was there really any ambiguity?<br/> <br/>My .02<br/> <br/>Cheers, always appreciate the input.  :)<br/></td>', 'The reason I stopped melting the ice when I did was that the fissure you see on the top left was threatening to crack the whole composition. Many comments about taking the plastic off, though I don''t see how that detracts from the photo. What amused me though, and given, if this was a stand-alone exhibit in a gallery all comments would be spot on, was how many mentioned the lack of visibility of the label.  If you sat and scored in one sitting, did you not have it memorized?  Was there really any ambiguity? My .02 Cheers, always appreciate the input.  :)', '2012-02-01 04:57:46.000000', NULL, 0),
